# Files excluded from a packaged `.vsix` (when someone runs `vsce package`).
#
# NOTE: `node_modules/` is deliberately NOT excluded — the extension's ONE runtime dependency
# (`vscode-languageclient`) must ship inside the `.vsix`. `vsce` prunes devDependencies itself; we have
# none, so the whole tree is runtime and stays.

# Per-machine install artifact baked by `cargo xtask install-lsp` — must NOT be published (it points at
# one machine's `cdz` binary). A published `.vsix` resolves the server via the `cadenza.server.path`
# setting or `cdz` on PATH instead.
.cdz-server-path

# Dev/repo bookkeeping — not part of the shipped extension.
.gitignore
package-lock.json
**/*.vsix
